message: "If you use this code, please cite this repository and the MALLORN data paper."
title: "Fractional-Order Features for TDE Light-Curve Classification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lei
    given-names: Hengbo
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-06-01
abstract: >-
  Research code for classifying tidal disruption events in simulated LSST
  light curves using FFT-based fractional-order differentiation, statistical
  feature fusion, and tree-based machine-learning models.
keywords:
  - tidal disruption events
  - light curves
  - fractional-order differentiation
  - time-domain astronomy
  - machine learning
references:
